      "content": "Details of Kshethram:\nMoolavar: Tiruvazhmarban\nThayaar: Kamalavalli Nachiyar\nVimanam: Indrakalyana Vimanam\nPushkarani: Lakshmi Theertham\n\nTravel: This kshethram is located 4 km from Nagercoil.\n\nAzhwar Pasuram:\nNam Azhwar: 1 pasuram",
